# 2024王江涛高分写作 - 小作文书信类
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 2024王江涛高分写作
# 描述: 2024版考研英语小作文书信类写作模板、格式规范与常用表达

{{小作文基本要求}}{{100-120词，10分，15分钟完成。格式包括称呼、正文（三段）、结束语、署名。}}{{2024版在2023基础上增加了更多真题范文和分类训练，强化了各类书信的写作技巧。}}

{{书信格式-称呼}}{{Dear Sir/Madam,（不知姓名）/ Dear Professor/Dr. + 姓,（知道头衔）/ Dear Mr./Ms. + 姓,（知道姓名）/ Dear friends/classmates,（群体）}}{{称呼后用逗号，正式信用Dear Sir/Madam，非正式信用Dear + 名字。}}

{{书信格式-结束语和署名}}{{Yours sincerely,（知道姓名）/ Yours faithfully,（不知姓名）/ Best regards,（半正式）/ Li Ming（英语一）/ Zhang Wei（英语二）}}{{结束语首字母大写，后加逗号，另起行写署名。}}

{{建议信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to express my suggestions regarding ... 正文：Firstly, ... Secondly, ... Finally, ... 结尾：I hope you will find these suggestions helpful.}}{{建议信三段式结构。}}

{{邀请信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to invite you to ... 正文：The event will be held on ... at ... 结尾：We would be honored if you could attend. / I am looking forward to your reply.}}{{邀请信三段式结构。}}

{{感谢信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to express my sincere gratitude for ... 正文：Your help/support meant a lot to me. 结尾：Thank you again for your kindness.}}{{感谢信三段式结构。}}

{{道歉信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to apologize for ... 正文：I understand that ... 结尾：I assure you that it will not happen again.}}{{道歉信三段式结构。}}

{{投诉信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to express my dissatisfaction with ... 正文：The product/service failed to ... 结尾：I would appreciate it if you could look into this matter.}}{{投诉信三段式结构。}}

{{推荐信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to recommend ... to you. 正文：He/She is an excellent ... 结尾：I am confident that he/she will be an ideal candidate.}}{{推荐信三段式结构。}}

{{申请信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to apply for ... 正文：I believe I am well-qualified because ... 结尾：I would be grateful if you could consider my application.}}{{申请信三段式结构。}}

{{祝贺信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to congratulate you on ... 正文：Your achievement is well-deserved. 结尾：Wish you even greater success in the future.}}{{祝贺信三段式结构。}}

{{通知/告示模板}}{{标题：NOTICE / 正文：We are pleased to announce that ... / 时间地点：The event will be held on ... at ... / 落款：Students' Union / Date}}{{通知格式，标题居中。}}

{{慰问信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to express my sympathy/concern for ... 正文：I was sorry to hear that ... 结尾：I hope you will recover soon.}}{{慰问信三段式结构。}}

{{请求信模板}}{{开头：I am writing to ask for your assistance with ... 正文：I would be grateful if you could ... 结尾：Thank you for your time and consideration.}}{{请求信三段式结构。}}

{{常用开头句型}}{{I am writing to ... / I would like to ... / It is my pleasure to ... / I am delighted to ... / I regret to inform you that ... / I am sorry to tell you that ...}}{{各类书信通用开头句型。}}

{{常用结尾句型}}{{I am looking forward to your reply. / Your prompt attention to this matter would be greatly appreciated. / Thank you for your time and consideration. / Please do not hesitate to contact me if you need further information.}}{{各类书信通用结尾句型。}}

{{常用连接词}}{{Firstly/Secondly/Thirdly / In addition/Furthermore / Moreover/Besides / However/Nevertheless / Therefore/Consequently / In conclusion/To sum up}}{{连接词使文章逻辑清晰。}}

{{语气把握}}{{正式语气：I would appreciate it if ... / I am writing to inquire about ... 半正式：Could you please ... / I would like to know ... 非正式：I was wondering if ... / Would you mind ...}}{{根据收信人身份选择合适语气。}}

{{常用句式升级}}{{基础：I think you should... → 升级：I would suggest/recommend that you... / 基础：Please help me → 升级：I would appreciate your assistance with... / 基础：I'm sorry → 升级：I sincerely apologize for...}}{{句式升级让书信表达更高级、更正式。}}
{{常见错误提醒}}{{1.格式不正确 2.称呼与结束语不匹配 3.词数不足或超限 4.语气不当 5.遗漏题目要求的要点 6.拼写和语法错误}}{{避免常见扣分点。}}
